      "section": "খ) সংযোগবিধি",
      "caption": null,
      "body": "(১) $(A \\cup B) \\cup C = A \\cup (B \\cup C)$ (২) $(A \\cap B) \\cap C = A \\cap (B \\cap C)$",
      "image": null,
      "formulas": [
        "(A \\cup B) \\cup C = A \\cup (B \\cup C)",
        "(A \\cap B) \\cap C = A \\cap (B \\cap C)"
