      "section": "গ) বণ্টনবিধি",
      "caption": null,
      "body": "(১) $A \\cup (B \\cap C) = (A \\cup B) \\cap (A \\cup C)$\n(২) $A \\cap (B \\cup C) = (A \\cap B) \\cup (A \\cap C)$",
      "image": null,
      "formulas": [
        "A \\cup (B \\cap C) = (A \\cup B) \\cap (A \\cup C)",
        "A \\cap (B \\cup C) = (A \\cap B) \\cup (A \\cap C)"
