      "body": "(১) $A \\cup A = A, A \\cap A = A$ (২) $A \\cup \\varnothing = A, A \\cap \\varnothing = \\varnothing$\n(৩) $A \\cup U = U, A \\cap U = A$ (৪) $A \\subseteq B \\implies B' \\subseteq A'$\n(৫) $A \\subseteq B \\implies A \\cup B = B$ (৬) $A \\subseteq B \\implies A \\cap B = A$",
      "image": null,
